{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23593","headline":"重题小舫赠周从事兼戏微之 · 白居易","name":"重题小舫赠周从事兼戏微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细[篷]青篾织鱼鳞，小眼红窗衬麴尘。\n阔狭才容从事座，高低恰称使君身。\n舞筵须拣腰轻女，仙櫂难胜骨重人。\n不似镜湖廉使出，高樯大艑闹惊春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}